Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was dark in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I stood in the hall and carefully opened the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Mom lying in bed, and I heard her breathing heavily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I stood at the head of the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I whispered her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I waited until she'd recognize me in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I hit her.
